  <preamble>At a duly called meeting of the Council of San Ildefonso Pueblo on the 25th day of June, 2026, the following law was adopted:</preamble>
  <codify:insert path="6.3" codified:doc="Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code" codified:path="|6.3.34">
    <container>
      <prefix>Part</prefix>
